#N canvas 20 20 1900 1400 12;
#X text 20 20 e_rush -- knob 4's far end \, in c_kit (Brendan \, 2026-11-05): "that recording keeps getting higher and higher pitched as the knob continues turning." The kit's whole output \, dry and wet \, is recorded all the time. Past the handoff the recording freezes \, the last steps of it loop at the rate asked \, and the live kit is muted \, ringing on underneath. Up at the top it thins to a sine and then to nothing \, where the loop would only buzz. c_steps says when. ref/module/sequencer.md, f 70;
#X text 20 190 creation args: none. signal inlet: the kit. inlet: on <span> <hz> \, span ms of recording played hz times a second \; rate <hz> <ms> \, the rate moved over ms \; mix <loop> <sine> \, the two gains \; off \, it is let go \; and back \, it is let go slowly and its place told. outlet~: the kit \, its loop or the sine. outlet 2: at a back \, the loop's place \, 0 to 1., f 70;
#X obj 20 340 inlet~;
#X obj 900 340 inlet;
