#X text 20 20 The sine that takes over from the loop at the top \, where the loop is only aliasing: at 22 kHz two samples a cycle drift through the recording \, a buzz at the difference. At the loop's frequency \, as loud as it was \, on only while its mix is above 0. Crossed in and faded out by c_steps.lua's R.RUSH_RAW \, R.RUSH_PURE and R.RUSH_HZ., f 70;
